  "content": "<a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/bisect\"><img width=100% src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702795/bisect.png\"></a>\n<img width=100% src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ObscuriaLithium/obscurialithium.github.io/refs/heads/main/assets/images/obscure-tooltips-logo.jpg\">\n\n<center>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"NeoForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neo%20Forge-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=231C25&color=5c2a21\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/obscure-tooltips-media-kit-VPpfjxP\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"媒體素材包\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/獲取%20媒體素材包-5c4521?style=for-the-badge&logo=imgur&labelColor=251C20&logoColor=white\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n### <center>Obscure Tooltips 是一款純客戶端的視覺增強模組，能將普通的物品提示框轉變為生動、動畫化的展示櫥窗。它透過流暢的動畫、動態粒子效果，以及能根據物品稀有度與情境自適應的裝飾邊框，為你的物品欄注入沉浸式視覺魅力。</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769699368/header/features.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769703577/obscure-tooltips-showcase-1.gif\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>動畫提示框</h1>\n            <p>流暢的動畫、發光的邊框與細微的粒子效果，讓每個提示框都活靈活現。多種樣式支援豐富的視覺潤飾——從動畫裝飾到分層特效——讓每個物品都感覺獨一無二、富有表現力。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>內建模型</h1>\n            <p>直接在提示框內以完整的 3D 形式預覽任何盔甲部件、工具或武器。無需裝備或開啟額外選單，即可即時預覽裝備。</p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769703746/obscure-tooltips-showcase-2.jpg\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769703975/obscure-tooltips-showcase-3.gif\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>平滑捲動</h1>\n            <p>當提示框超出螢幕高度時，自動啟動平滑捲動功能，保持文字清晰可讀而不顯凌亂。讓你無需調整 UI 就能自然閱讀長篇描述。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>自動換行</h1>\n            <p>智慧換行功能讓寬提示框保持乾淨、易讀且格式完美。長名稱、背景故事與屬性數值排列整齊，不會超出版面。</p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769703747/obscure-tooltips-showcase-4.jpg\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4yIqabL.gif\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>無可比擬的自訂性</h1>\n            <p>Obscure Tooltips 是第一款引入全動畫化、視覺豐富提示框的模組；雖然此後出現了類似模組，但其模組化、資料驅動的設計依然提供獨一無二的靈活性，讓你能<a href=\"https://obscurialithium.github.io/obscure-tooltips/#tooltip-styles\">建構</a>與<a href=\"https://obscurialithium.github.io/obscure-tooltips/#style-merging-fallback\">合併樣式</a>、<a href=\"https://obscurialithium.github.io/obscure-tooltips/#tooltip-filters\">建立條件</a>，並<a href=\"https://obscurialithium.github.io/obscure-tooltips/#core-concept\">自訂每個元素</a>以符合你的構想。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2zmjwZJ.png\"></center>\n\n<br>\n\n## 遊戲內設定\n在 Minecraft 1.20.1 版本中，使用 [Forge Config Screens](https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-screens) 或 [Configured](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured) 即可開啟遊戲內設定選單。若未安裝這些模組，仍可透過設定檔調整所有選項（位置：<i>config/obscuria/obscure_tooltips-client.toml</i>）。從 Minecraft 1.21.1 開始，遊戲內設定畫面已內建支援，無需額外安裝依賴。\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769699408/header/more-from-obscuria.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aquamirae\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/aquamirae.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/obscure-tooltips\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/obscure-tooltips.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pillager-caravans\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/pillager-caravans.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ars-elixirum\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/ars-elixirum.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/accents\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/blank.png\" width=\"45%\" />\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/patreon.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/discord.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>",
